1
00:00:00,826 --> 00:00:03,956
(Sheldon:)That's Northwest Texas.
I'm from East Texas, the Gulf region...

2
00:00:04,121 --> 00:00:06,911
(Sheldon:)...home to many Vietnamese shrimpers.

3
00:00:07,416 --> 00:00:09,586
(Leonard:)Do the shrimpers feature in your story?

4
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:12,089
(Howard:)No.

5
00:00:12,838 --> 00:00:15,218
Anyway, when I was 8...

6
00:00:15,382 --> 00:00:20,092
...a Montgomery Ward delivery van
ran over our family cat, Lucky.

7
00:00:21,555 --> 00:00:23,435
- "Lucky"?
- Yes, "Lucky."

8
00:00:23,599 --> 00:00:26,269
(Leonard:)He's irony impaired. Just move on.

9
00:00:27,019 --> 00:00:29,859
(Howard:)Okay, dead cat named Lucky. Continue.

10
00:00:30,022 --> 00:00:31,692
(Sheldon:)While others mourned Lucky...

11
00:00:31,857 --> 00:00:36,157
...I realized his untimely demise provided
me with the opportunity to replace him...

12
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,610
(Sheldon:)...with something
more suited to my pet needs.

13
00:00:38,781 --> 00:00:41,451
(Sheldon:)A faithful companion
that I could snuggle with at night...

14
00:00:41,617 --> 00:00:45,537
(Sheldon:)...yet would be capable of killing
upon telepathic command.

15
00:00:47,414 --> 00:00:49,664
(Howard:)So not a puppy?

16
00:00:49,875 --> 00:00:51,665
(Sheldon:)Please. No, nothing so pedestrian.

17
00:00:51,835 --> 00:00:54,465
(Sheldon:)I wanted a griffin.

18
00:00:55,381 --> 00:00:59,131
- A griffin?
- Yes, half eagle, half lion.

